-- Companions: the vanilla items Forever's loot tables expect. The Forever 1.60.1 client keeps them in Item.db2 (class,
-- slot, icon) and ItemModifiedAppearance (model), but not in ItemSparse: the server does not know them, so their loot rows
-- never drop (the BRD and Molten Core boss loot, Onyxia's tier 2 helms...). Built from TrinityCore TDB 335.26091
-- (item_template, locales): name, stats as allocations of the client's RandPropPoints budget (resistances 51-56, bonus
-- armor 50), damage spread and delay (the damage itself follows the client's damage tables, as for Forever's own weapons),
-- flags, prices, item sets the client has; the TDB spells as item effects unless the client already has effects for the
-- item; an appearance only where the client has none for the item's model (0 here).
-- 1416 items, 11316 translations, 1160 item effects. Generated: re-running removes and re-adds the
-- same rows (hotfix push 2610261; ids from 9910001 are ours).
